# Mumma Chelles - Cursor Project Rules

## PROJECT IDENTITY
- **Client:** Michelle Thomas (Mumma Chelle)
- **Domain:** mummachelles.com.au
- **Purpose:** Curated resource hub for book, toy, and educational recommendations targeting educators, carers, homeschoolers, and parents
- **Revenue:** Amazon Associates AU (tracking ID: mummachelles2-22) + Nu Skin wellbeing products

## ARCHITECTURE
Hybrid: Next.js on Vercel (static pages) + WordPress on Hostinger (Amazon affiliate content via AAWP plugin). Vercel rewrite proxy connects both under one domain.

Next.js handles: /, /about, /contact, /resources, /wellbeing/*, /sensory-insights, /terms, /privacy, /members
WordPress handles (via Vercel rewrites): /toys, /books, /blog/*

## TECH STACK
- Next.js 14+ with App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v3
- Framer Motion (animations)
- Lucide React (icons)
- Google Fonts: Playfair Display (headings), Lato (body), Dancing Script (logo only)

## BRAND TOKENS
--bg: #fdf5f5           /* Blush background */
--plum: #3d1a2e         /* Primary - headings, nav, footer */
--pink-hot: #c9699a     /* Accent - buttons, links, highlights */
--pink-soft: #e8b4c8    /* Borders, subtle accents */
--pink-pale: #f9edf3    /* Light background alternating sections */
--gold: #a07850          /* Tags, labels, category badges */
--text: #1a1a1a          /* Body text */
--text-muted: #666666   /* Secondary text */
--white: #ffffff         /* Cards, overlays */

## TAILWIND CONFIG
colors: {
  plum: '#3d1a2e',
  'pink-hot': '#c9699a',
  'pink-soft': '#e8b4c8',
  'pink-pale': '#f9edf3',
