## DESIGN DIRECTION
Warm, nurturing, professional. "Curated boutique" feel, NOT corporate.
- Smooth scroll-triggered fade-in animations on sections (Framer Motion)
- Card hover effects: subtle lift + shadow transition
- Sticky header: transparent at top, solid plum on scroll
- Mobile nav: slide-out drawer (not dropdown)
- Rounded corners on cards (rounded-2xl)
- Micro-interactions on buttons (scale on hover)
- Alternating section backgrounds: blush (#fdf5f5) and pink-pale (#f9edf3)
- Generous whitespace between sections

## SPACING CONVENTIONS
- Section padding: py-16 md:py-24
- Card padding: p-6 md:p-8
- Component gap: gap-6 md:gap-8
- Max content width: max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8
- Border radius on cards: rounded-2xl

## COMPONENT NAMING
Use PascalCase. All shared components in /components/:
- layout/: Header, Footer, MobileNav, PageWrapper
- ui/: Button, Card, CategoryCard, Badge, SectionHeading, HeroBanner, ResourceCard, ProductCard
- forms/: ContactForm, NewsletterForm
- sections/: BookCategories, ToyShowcase, FreeResources, SensoryInsights, ContactCTA, NewsletterBanner
- seo/: JsonLd, MetaTags

## CONTENT RULES
- Tagline: "Books to Cherish. Toys to Love. Resources to Nourish."
- Footer credit: "Web Design by Limitless Creations AI" linked to https://limitlesscreations.ai
- Affiliate disclosure (on Amazon pages): "As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases. This helps me to continue to create resources and content."
- NEVER use em dashes in any text content. Use hyphens, commas, or colons instead.

## NAVIGATION ITEMS
HOME, ABOUT, BOOKS, TOYS, RESOURCES, WELLBEING (dropdown: Feel Calm, Night Time, Y-Span), SENSORY INSIGHTS, BLOG, CONTACT
Members Login as ghost button (links to /members coming soon page)

